pre-OE *gzeweeldjan ‘to control, to rule’ > Angl. OE *geewaldjan > North. geweelda
(cf. WS gewieldan); deriv. of PGmc *waldang ‘to control, to rule’ > WS wealdan,
Merc. waldan;
